          {
            "point": "Wooden pipes designed and sent to the CNC"
          },
          {
            "point": "Pipe panels and pipes in 3D in PipeViewer"
          },
          {
            "point": "Live pressure curves and diagnostics for every smARTvalve"
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "In our workshop",
          "title": "PipeCreator: from pipe design to every valve",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "PipeCreator is the program we use ourselves. It designs our wooden organ pipes and sends the G-code straight to our 5-axis CNC. In its 3D view, PipeViewer, we design the pipe panels for a smARTvalve organ and the pipes on them, so customers see their own organ in 3D before it is built.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Once the organ plays, PipeCreator shows a live pressure curve for every pipe next to the expected curve, and a diagnostics table for all smARTvalves.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
          "image": {},
          "video": {
            "link_type": "Media"
          },
